  "body": "Stacked on #1717 (branch `issue/1648-wcs-page-work-offset`). Merge #1717 first; retarget this PR to `main` before the parent merges.\n\n## What changed\n- The group \"Set WCS from features\" (the \"Pick for WCS\" button, the role box for Origin / X / Y / Z, the picked list and Apply) moves from the Setup page to the WCS page. It sits in its own group directly above \"Work offset (G54-G59)\".\n- The Setup page no longer has that group. It keeps \"Active setup\", \"Stock source\", \"Part orientation\" and \"This setup\" unchanged. `GROUPS` in `setup_settings_page.rs` has four titles now.\n- The pick row wraps its line, so \"Pick for WCS\" stays inside the narrow pane.\n- Pick gate: the per-frame sweep (`axis_pick::disarm_hidden`) keeps a draft while its row is drawn. The row marks itself drawn. The gate follows the row, not the Setup page, so \"Pick for WCS\" takes viewport picks on the WCS page. No gate code changed.\n- No new command. Apply queues the same `SetWcs`. Undo and redo are as before.\n- `docs/decisions/1926-wcs-picks-on-wcs-page.md` supersedes the part of the #1648 decision that kept the row on the Setup page.\n- MCP: no new command, so no MCP tool is owed (the tool for this action already exists).\n\n## Images\nBefore = head of #1717. After = this PR.\n\nSetup page, before: ![](https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/blob/1206e652b2e985756946f7c65e8d917736df1544/pr-1931/before-setup.png?raw=true)\n\nSetup page, after: ![](https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/blob/1206e652b2e985756946f7c65e8d917736df1544/pr-1931/after-setup.png?raw=true)\n\nWCS page, before: ![](https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/blob/1206e652b2e985756946f7c65e8d917736df1544/pr-1931/before-wcs.png?raw=true)\n\nWCS page, after: ![](https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/blob/1206e652b2e985756946f7c65e8d917736df1544/pr-1931/after-wcs.png?raw=true)\n\n## Tests\n- New `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/wcs_page_picks.rs` (3 tests): the WCS page shows the group next to the work offset and the Setup page does not; an armed row on the WCS page stays armed across frames and leaving the page pauses it; picks from the WCS page place the WCS and undo restores it.\n- Updated `tests/setup_settings_page.rs`: the Setup page has no feature-pick row.\n- Run: `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- egui_app` (613 passed, 3 ignored snapshot tests) and `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` (clean).\n\n## Not exercised\n- Snapshot PNG lane (release only; no PNG changed).\n- A real viewport click on the WCS page (the click path is the existing `wcs_pick_click_tests`; the new test covers the gate and Apply).\n- Other ui test binaries and the full gate.\n\nChangelog: Set WCS from features (the picks that set the WCS origin and axes) moved from the Setup page to the WCS page.\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #1926\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
